  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3106c6c6c89e2369aca2858123761c2cb14e7ad1?download\" data-file-name=\"정전기실험10.hwp\" data-file-size=\"2397184\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D338%26fileid%3D18%26regdt%3D20250227003027&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F3106c6c6c89e2369aca2858123761c2cb14e7ad1')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">정전기실험10</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">2.29MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a6145e304b97a228a80aef69135131bb5ca96cee?download\" data-file-name=\"정전기실험10.pdf\" data-file-size=\"115586\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D338%26fileid%3D19%26regdt%3D20250227003027&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fa6145e304b97a228a80aef69135131bb5ca96cee')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">정전기실험10</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">112.88KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ed8c84823cd35f6f300dd412220bd5bb6d75f979?download\" data-file-name=\"지식시장-정전기실험활동지.hwp\" data-file-size=\"1863168\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D338%26fileid%3D20%26regdt%3D20250227003027&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fed8c84823cd35f6f300dd412220bd5bb6d75f979')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">지식시장-정전기실험활동지</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">1.78MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ecbb1127ded64e2cb6c27385cacabcd3b88fdc80?download\" data-file-name=\"지식시장-정전기실험활동지.pdf\" data-file-size=\"467073\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D338%26fileid%3D21%26regdt%3D20250227003027&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fecbb1127ded64e2cb6c27385cacabcd3b88fdc80')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">지식시장-정전기실험활동지</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">456.13KB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>2022년에 했던 수업인데, 이제 올려봅니다^^</p><p>당시에 10개 실험을 찾아 정리해두었네요. 이거 말고도 간이검전기 만들기도 있고요. 다음해에 작은 종이컵을 매단 풍선을 정전기힘으로 천장에 붙이고 수수깡 어느 조가 제일 많이 넣나.. 하는 실험을 동료선생님이 하시더라구요.</p><p>유튜브 등에서 검색하시면 이것 말고도 더 많을 거에요~</p><p>&#160;</p><p>마찰전기+정전기유도 주제로 할 수 있는 실험이 많아서 본격적인 전압, 전류 들어가기 전에 지식시장으로 운영하기 좋았습니다~</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #5733b1;\"><b>모둠별로 실험 1개를 선택하여 자료를 준비하고(1시간), 지식시장 운영(2시간) 했습니다.&#160;</b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #5733b1;\"><b>두번째 지식시장 시간에 수업공개를 하였구요.&#160;</b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #5733b1;\"><b>마지막에 &#39;라이덴병&#39; 이야기를 하면서 반전체가 둥그렇게 모여 손잡고 감전되어?!보는 체험하는 것으로 마무리했습니다.</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>하나씩 참고용 자료 보여드릴께요.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1) 정전기 관련 실험 정리</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/76813aef59c448b248dd2bcd4a0f2a91a10d82d4\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"567\" height=\"427\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/76813aef59c448b248dd2bcd4a0f2a91a10d82d4\" data-origin-width=\"1477\" data-origin-height=\"1113\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6713798f16c30470d84f42923daa000729a0454a\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"563\" height=\"422\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6713798f16c30470d84f42923daa000729a0454a\" data-origin-width=\"1481\" data-origin-height=\"1111\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/22bd5208052be0721c32c970f2d83948775f742f\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"566\" height=\"425\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/22bd5208052be0721c32c970f2d83948775f742f\" data-origin-width=\"1473\" data-origin-height=\"1105\"></div><p>2) 실험 준비: 아날로그로 4절 도화지에 각 모둠별로 실험에 대해 설명자료를 만들었습니다</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/295e035ebe0af3fe690c389729fbaa721f496cc9\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"564\" height=\"423\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/295e035ebe0af3fe690c389729fbaa721f496cc9\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e803fd68d764a09fa3fbb3c2269c225ded8e2cbb\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"559\" height=\"414\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e803fd68d764a09fa3fbb3c2269c225ded8e2cbb\" data-origin-width=\"1353\" data-origin-height=\"1002\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/baa1a18e9772ed54051caaee21c2199229cbab23\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"558\" height=\"435\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/baa1a18e9772ed54051caaee21c2199229cbab23\" data-origin-width=\"1320\" data-origin-height=\"1030\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/08d4c692fbf6f7e6cb705ebe9bd7b72ae4b7fc23\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"555\" height=\"418\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/08d4c692fbf6f7e6cb705ebe9bd7b72ae4b7fc23\" data-origin-width=\"1404\" data-origin-height=\"1058\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fb083d352f025ac21fe4238af2aaaf69344a5768\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"551\" height=\"416\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fb083d352f025ac21fe4238af2aaaf69344a5768\" data-origin-width=\"1388\" data-origin-height=\"1048\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7d47a837170c516b621df24470f2350c43b00ace\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"551\" height=\"394\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7d47a837170c516b621df24470f2350c43b00ace\" data-origin-width=\"1376\" data-origin-height=\"984\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2dcb50dbe46ab652e553d08198209a1d864f46e5\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"554\" height=\"410\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2dcb50dbe46ab652e553d08198209a1d864f46e5\" data-origin-width=\"1358\" data-origin-height=\"1004\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7e5c9c9fd8942421caebf3470b200dc648ef9ec6\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"553\" height=\"406\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7e5c9c9fd8942421caebf3470b200dc648ef9ec6\" data-origin-width=\"1374\" data-origin-height=\"1010\"></div><p>3) 모둠에서 A팀, B팀을 나누어 첫 시간에는 A팀이 설명을 하고, B팀이 모둠별로 다니면서 설명도 듣고 실험도 직접 해 봅니다. 간단하게 활동지도 작성하구요. 모둠별로 주어진 시간이 너무 짧아서 작성은 사실 대에에충 했네요. (평가와 연계하지는 않았어요)&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6e01c6c1af1637113ad1daf1d15d9fc41101a2be\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"487\" height=\"358\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6e01c6c1af1637113ad1daf1d15d9fc41101a2be\" data-origin-width=\"1384\" data-origin-height=\"1018\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/356a560adcf34f36655616de8c2db7d5cbaaa7d7\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"488\" height=\"366\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/356a560adcf34f36655616de8c2db7d5cbaaa7d7\" data-origin-width=\"1356\" data-origin-height=\"1018\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9148e9a03a1f1b2d428ce2b104700a8f2c6e57af\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"494\" height=\"358\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9148e9a03a1f1b2d428ce2b104700a8f2c6e57af\" data-origin-width=\"1379\" data-origin-height=\"999\"></div><p>4) 진행시 PPT가 남아 있네요! 별 내용은 없어요.&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1Rp577Cbo42BGLC95x2ebScg9RFFVBMMxzezT6W6pGoc/edit#slide=id.g1323d0ad6b0_0_95\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1Rp577Cbo42BGLC95x2ebScg9RFFVBMMxzezT6W6pGoc/edit#slide=id.g1323d0ad6b0_0_95</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"정전기지식시장\" data-og-description=\"지식시장에 오신걸 환영합니다 모둠별로 실험과 설명연습, 활동지 점검 해주세요\" data-og-host=\"docs.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1Rp577Cbo42BGLC95x2ebScg9RFFVBMMxzezT6W6pGoc/edit#slide=id.g1323d0ad6b0_0_95\" data-og-url=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1Rp577Cbo42BGLC95x2ebScg9RFFVBMMxzezT6W6pGoc/edit?usp=embed_facebook\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dfikw5/hyYm2DNeER/jyN4QfucxVW9kOsOkcvJO1/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1Rp577Cbo42BGLC95x2ebScg9RFFVBMMxzezT6W6pGoc/edit#slide=id.g1323d0ad6b0_0_95\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1Rp577Cbo42BGLC95x2ebScg9RFFVBMMxzezT6W6pGoc/edit#slide=id.g1323d0ad6b0_0_95\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dfikw5/hyYm2DNeER/jyN4QfucxVW9kOsOkcvJO1/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">정전기지식시장</p><p class=\"og-desc\">지식시장에 오신걸 환영합니다 모둠별로 실험과 설명연습, 활동지 점검 해주세요</p><p class=\"og-host\">docs.google.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">5) 모둠별 설명이 끝나면 축전기 잠깐 말하면서 감전 실험을 마무리로 했습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">김정식 수석님거 따라했고요. 요거 할 때 Fun Fly Stick (정전기 발생 막대) 이용해서 실패 없이 강력하게 감전시켰습니다.ㅋㅋ</p><p>&#160;</p><p>축전기 접시 만들어 감전시키기 (<a href=\"https://sciencelove.com/1390\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencelove.com/1390)</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"축전기 접시 만들어 감전 시키기 - 전류흐름\" data-og-description=\"축전기 접시를 만들어 학생들을 감전시켜 보았습니다. 전류의 흐름에 대한 설명을 할때 사용하면 좋다. 물론 희망자를 대상으로 했구요. 싫어하는 학생들은 시키지 않았습니다. 남학교라 서로 \" data-og-host=\"sciencelove.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://sciencelove.com/1390\" data-og-url=\"https://sciencelove.com/1390\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/krs1c/hyYjNaskXC/09aHtsTJ5s0hUYkp7xyyP1/img.png?width=492&amp;height=254&amp;face=152_8_182_40,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/YYZmv/hyYjw7E3ME/skCHX4gcNoadIEhy0vkBgk/img.png?width=492&amp;height=254&amp;face=152_8_182_40,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/V0wp2/hyYmLhMi9R/rpJ5YLThOpKnsWc06pi3yk/img.png?width=492&amp;height=254&amp;face=152_8_182_40\"><a href=\"https://sciencelove.com/1390\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://sciencelove.com/1390\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/krs1c/hyYjNaskXC/09aHtsTJ5s0hUYkp7xyyP1/img.png?width=492&amp;height=254&amp;face=152_8_182_40,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/YYZmv/hyYjw7E3ME/skCHX4gcNoadIEhy0vkBgk/img.png?width=492&amp;height=254&amp;face=152_8_182_40,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/V0wp2/hyYmLhMi9R/rpJ5YLThOpKnsWc06pi3yk/img.png?width=492&amp;height=254&amp;face=152_8_182_40\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">축전기 접시 만들어 감전 시키기 - 전류흐름</p><p class=\"og-desc\">축전기 접시를 만들어 학생들을 감전시켜 보았습니다. 전류의 흐름에 대한 설명을 할때 사용하면 좋다. 물론 희망자를 대상으로 했구요. 싫어하는 학생들은 시키지 않았습니다. 남학교라 서로 </p><p class=\"og-host\">sciencelove.com</p></div></a></div><p>6) 요섭샘이 보시면 너무 싫어할만한 구체적이지 않고 의미없는 평가지 ㅋㅋ 아래 개인구매활동지(양면)가 설명 듣는 아이들이 적는 활동지입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4f5e1316e907d04f244e6ef3219c9c8c2f136599\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"529\" height=\"705\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4f5e1316e907d04f244e6ef3219c9c8c2f136599\" data-origin-width=\"1095\" data-origin-height=\"146